  partName: Fan Belt
  description: The Fan Belt is a tiny, elongated component positioned at the middle-center-front
    of the engine, responsible for driving the cooling fan and other accessories.
    Made of Chrome.001, this fan belt provides a durable and long-lasting connection
    between the engine and its accessories. Notably, the fan belt's elongated shape
    and chrome material enable it to withstand high speeds and temperatures, ensuring
    reliable engine operation.
